        "TileImage": "$($repository 2486a862-49f0-43cc-b0d3-58b845c4736e).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned five High Value Targets (HVTs) at the Sceptre Al-Ghazali in Dubai, UAE. Below are the listed targets as well as the preferred kill method for each of them;\r\rEliminate Cornelia Stuyvesant and Lucy Phillips with a falling object.\rEliminate Hans Lucht via drowning. \rEliminate Zana Kazemi with Fiber wire.\rEliminate Omar Al-Ghazali with injected lethal poison. \r\rLots of high profile guests at the event, so no non-target casualties.\r\rGood luck and enjoy the view!\rReapingZ",
